        "slc_bfc6aab6f6415f43f91dda5a5849b071478a8be910aa0684ee04d2504bb270bc"
      ],
      "text": "The project ships 8 agent manifests, 8 slash commands, hooks, and one orchestration rule as pure Markdown/config files for Cursor, with no external runtime or wrapper CLI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7cb6ed239ff8b943c9be60f56704dec43f47c49a25732229f61c4032a72f9b78",
