        "slc_3eca53ca0c37df9aabe701e9a6313e26bd7bc1bd6bcad4366e3187dbb0329218"
      ],
      "text": "A '/cactus-juice' swarm mode decomposes requests into 5-10 independent single-file micro-tasks and spawns up to 10 parallel fast-model subagents, with the root collecting and verifying results."
    },
