        "slc_4aa6dd7c599217ff96ad12dc6539a47472b97bb26f36c1b3131c3f8b968ede59"
      ],
      "text": "On Cursor 3.4+ a two-tier swarm pattern applies: coordinators (Aang, Sokka, Katara, Appa) spawn worker agents (Toph, Momo) as leaf nodes with max depth 2; Zuko is root-only."
    },
