        "slc_be7dde30efbb71b79f1b6b3864f00605bd465f48b518aca125282f542e7bb093"
      ],
      "text": "Hooks wired via .cursor/hooks.json include guard-shell.sh, which blocks destructive shell commands and commits containing anti-patterns like 'as any' or '@ts-ignore', returning allow/deny/ask decisions on beforeShellExecution."
    },
