  "summary": "The project ships 8 agent manifests, 8 slash commands, hooks, and one orchestration rule as pure Markdown/config files for Cursor, with no external runtime or wrapper CLI. The orchestrator rule makes the root thread a pure dispatcher whose only permitted tools are Task, TodoWrite, AskQuestion, and SwitchMode, delegating all work to specialist agents. Evidence coverage: 157 of 294 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
